    "body": {
      "dataStream": "Product Requirements (PRD)\rDescribes the problem and the expected outcome — not the technical solution. Whoever builds it decides the how.\rProblem\rWhat hurts today, for whom, and how often. Without this, the rest is opinion.\rAudience\r\rObjective\r\rRequirements\rWhat has to exist for the problem to stop existing. Separate the must-haves from the nice-to-haves.\rOut of scope\r\rSuccess metrics\rHow we will know it worked — ideally something measurable.\r\n",
